Third-party material

The desktop suite's PDF view (#2245) draws, reads, searches and fills PDF
pages, converts a PDF to an editable document with its layout (#2257), and
prints and exports it as drawn (#2258), with the following crates and the data they embed.
Terminal docxy's `docxy-pdf` and the VS Code extension's `pdfpages.wasm`
(#2259) draw and read pages with the same renderer (pdfcraft-render and what
it brings: PdfCraft, hayro, Vello, lopdf and their embedded data below). Each is used under its
own licence; the crates' licence texts are in their sources, at the revisions
suite/Cargo.toml and suite/Cargo.lock pin.

- PdfCraft (pdfcraft-render, pdfcraft-cos, pdfcraft-fonts, pdfcraft-geom,
  pdfcraft-annot, pdfcraft-content, pdfcraft-forms, pdfcraft-model,
  pdfcraft-edit, pdfcraft-create, pdfcraft-export, pdfcraft-filters,
  pdfcraft-xfa, pdfcraft-print, pdfcraft-organize),
  https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft
  Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the PdfCraft contributors.
  MIT OR Apache-2.0.

- craft-libs (craft-pdf, craft-stream-codecs, hayro-postscript, and its
  own copy of hayro-jbig2 0.3.0 that craft-stream-codecs uses; for the
  conversion, craft-docx, craft-wordmodel, craft-opc, craft-xml, craft-zip,
  craft-drawingml, craft-pptx, craft-rtf, craft-markdown, craft-html,
  craft-flow, craft-math, craft-mime, craft-metafile, craft-cfb,
  craft-codepage, craft-offcrypto, craft-xfa, craft-image-codecs,
  craft-jpeg, craft-tiff; for printing, craft-print and craft-cms),
  https://github.com/storytold/craft-libs
  Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the craft-libs contributors;
  hayro-jbig2 Copyright (c) The Hayro Authors.
  MIT OR Apache-2.0.

- hayro (hayro, hayro-interpret, hayro-syntax, hayro-cmap, hayro-jbig2),
  https://github.com/LaurenzV/hayro, in PdfCraft's patched copies; and
  hayro-ccitt 0.3.0 and hayro-jpeg2000 0.3.5, the crates.io releases.
  Copyright (c) The Hayro Authors. MIT OR Apache-2.0.

- Vello (vello_cpu, vello_common 0.0.8), https://github.com/linebender/vello,
  in PdfCraft's patched copies; and vello_common 0.0.9, the crates.io
